  "title": "AMERANT BANK EXPANDS FOOTPRINT TO MIAMI BEACH WITH NEW BANKING CENTER",
  "summary": "MIAMI BEACH, FL (September 12, 2025) — Amerant Bank, Florida’s bank of choice with a growing presence throughout the state, announces the opening of its first-ever Miami Beach Banking Center, located at 427 W 41 St. This new location marks Amerant’s 21st banking center in Florida, and another significant step in the bank’s ongoing expansion …",
